<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34017" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pascŭus</span></b> , a, um, adj.
		pasco, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for pasture</i>, <i>grazing</i> (class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ager,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Truc. 1, 2, 47</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">agri, arvi et arbusti et pascui,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Rep. 5, 2, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rura,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					5, 1248</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">silva,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig. 50, 16, 30</span></i>
			; cf. in the foll.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pascŭum</span></b> ,
			i, n., <i>a pasture</i>
			(usu. in plur.; cf. pabulum). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ab viridi pascuo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 2, 11, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ne esuriens mittatur in pascuum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					8, 14, 8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rus quod pascuo caret,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 7,
					1, 1</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Plin. 8, 47, 72, §
			189</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(b).</b>
			<i>Plur.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in censorum pascuis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Agr. 1, 1, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gregem in pascua mittere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 3, 323</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pascua laeta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. F.
					4, 476</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pascua herbosa,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. M.
					2, 689</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Lucana,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					Epod. 1, 28</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">laeta Clitumni pascua,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Juv.
					12, 13</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">exire in pascua,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					10, 44, 61, § 126</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">etiam nunc in tabulis censoriis pascua dicuntur
					omnia, ex quibus populus reditus habet, quia diu hoc solum
					vectigal fuerat,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					18, 3, 3, § 11</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>food</i>
			(post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pascua jurulenta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 2, p. 117, 31</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pascŭa</span></b> ,
			ae, f. (sc. terra), <i>a
				pasture</i> (postclass.), <i><span class="en">Tert. Apol.
			22</span></i>, <i><span class="en">Vulg. Joel, 1, 18</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Ezech.
				34, 31</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
